[h1]Space Bar Pause[/h1]
Press [b]SPACE[/b] on the galactic map to pause, and press it again to resume. While you have the game paused, you can still give orders.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]Pause and resume galactic time with a single key. The on-screen Pause/Play button stays in sync.
[*][b]Orders while paused:[/b] move fleets, queue production on planets, and move troops between the surface and orbit. Nothing moves or builds until you unpause.
[*]Tactical battles are not affected. In battles, Space keeps its normal 'Camera Center' function.
[*]Works with data mods such as AotR and Thrawn's Revenge, including Workshop mods, because it changes no game data files.
[/list]

[h2]IMPORTANT: one-time install step[/h2]
This is a small code mod (a DLL). Steam cannot put it in the game folder for you, so subscribing alone is not enough:
[olist]
[*]Subscribe, and wait for Steam to download the item.
[*]In Steam, right-click the game > Manage > Browse local files. Go up two folders to [i]steamapps[/i], then open [i]workshop > content > 32470 > (this item's ID number)[/i].
[*]Double-click [b]Install.bat[/b]. It finds the game automatically.
[*]Start Forces of Corruption normally. You don't need to launch this item as a mod.
[/olist]
To uninstall, run [b]Uninstall.bat[/b] from the same folder.

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
[list]
[*]Requires the current Steam 64-bit release of Forces of Corruption (2024 patch).
[*]If a future game update changes the executable, the mod turns itself off safely. The game then runs normally until the mod is updated.
[*]Single player only. The game does not allow galactic pausing in multiplayer.
[/list]

[h2]Settings[/h2]
To change the key, or to turn off orders while paused, rename [i]SpaceBarPause.ini.example[/i] to [i]SpaceBarPause.ini[/i] and put it in the game's [i]corruption[/i] folder.

[h2]Source code & manual download[/h2]
Open source (MIT): [url=https://github.com/nandusmasta/swfoc-spacebar-pause]github.com/nandusmasta/swfoc-spacebar-pause[/url]
Some antivirus programs flag DLL mods that change the game's code in memory. You can read and build the full source yourself.

Mod by nanduskaiser.
